    "detailed_description": "(1/21/2023) This is the first big update to Blazted VR. This update balances and smooths out the gameplay.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCore improvements:<br />\r\n- New content (Zombies, Maps, Weapons)<br />\r\n- Texture Improvements<br />\r\n- Improved Combat System<br />\r\n- UI update and improvement<br />\r\n- Main Menu update<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n(W/ell designed Virtual reality, wave base zombie game. Drink beer to regain health with a toggleable drunk effect and kill zombies with cool melee weapons and guns. <br />\r\n(6/22/2023)<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\n- Drunk effect (turn on/off)<br />\r\n- Cool new maps<br />\r\n- Zombie variants<br />\r\n- Rush/Wave game mode<br />\r\n- 3 different wave modes<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n...<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIncase you are wondering:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n**At a college pub in the middle of no-where Midwest sits &quot;He&quot; and the other guy**<br />\r\n<br />\r\n &quot;Ya know, I want to shoot a bunch of zombies here&quot; He said while slurping his $5 pitcher of beer.<br />\r\n &quot;Sure.. sounds fun&quot; The other said uninterested.<br />\r\n &quot;I bet I could make a video game of it&quot; He said boldly while taking another gulp.<br />\r\n &quot;Could you?&quot; The other asked. <br />\r\n &quot;Sure can... I'll make it Virtual reality too.. Drinking beer and killing Zombies&quot; He said again nonchalant like and took another sip.<br />\r\n &quot;Prove it&quot; The other said.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n *He stops drinking his beer*<br />\r\n....",
